### =====================================================================
### shop-etl-pipeline API (VS Code "REST Client" / IntelliJ HTTP client)
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1) FULL LOAD (design doc mujab window end 2026-10-21 00:00 IST), sync: puru thay pachhi response
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/J2_SALES/runs?windowEnd=2026-10-21T00:00&mode=sync

### 2) INCREMENTAL 04:00 (02 Mongo script + 04 SQL PART B pachhi), async: turant runId
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/J2_SALES/runs?windowEnd=2026-10-21T04:00
X-Triggered-By: API

### 3) Run status (runId upar na response mathi)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/runs/J2_20261021_0400

### 4) Badha jobs + watermarks
GET {{host}}/api/jobs

### 5) Have sudhi no data (windowEnd vagar = current time)
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/J2_SALES/runs

### 6) Health (Airflow / load balancer)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
